notes=DEFAULT: 1280x720 16:9; 60 FPS; 64MB stock console; double buffering (1 backbuffer); stock FOV.<br><br>SELECT ONE MODE PER OFFSET: 1280x720 default; 720x480 or original 640x480 alternatives disabled [-].<br><br>720x480: use every 720x480 MODE record plus shared HD MODE records, not 1280x720 records.<br><br>640x480 stock: use every 640x480 MODE record and turn OFF the shared HD MODE records; use 640x480 records in their place.<br><br>BUFFER: change ALL FOUR DOUBLE records to ALL FOUR TRIPLE records together to get 2 backbuffers; never mix.<br><br>RAM: 64MB=0x05 default; 128MB=0x01 optional for upgraded consoles ONLY. The 128MB flag corrects an omission in source variants.<br><br>FOV: optional wider 0.666667 scalar (from 720x480 version); 1280x720 effect not runtime verified. FPS: optional original timing.<br><br>HD modes use Silverrock shared rendering and memory hooks; 1280x720 causes major slowdowns; cutscene blur artifacts may remain.<br><br>For Batman Begins NTSC-U XBE Version 2, Title ID 45410389. CRC32 from supplied XBE 9AE174F5 (pack states 3D9EF554).
